# Trivy ignore file — caddy-waf
#
# The two findings below are embedded in the Caddy 2.11.4 Go binary (usr/bin/caddy).
# No patched Caddy release exists yet: they are fixed in google.golang.org/grpc
# v1.82.2/v1.83.2, which requires a coraza-caddy release newer than v2.6.0 and
# Caddy >= 2.11.5.
#
# The four suppressions cleared by the v3.5.0 rebuild were removed on 2026-09-09
# (CVE-2026-56852, GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf, CVE-2026-46600, CVE-2026-56854 — grpc lifted
# to v1.82.1 by coraza-caddy v2.6.0, x/text/x/net/x/crypto lifted by the rebuild);
# see the SECURITY.md pending-advisories section for the resolution record.
#
# RE-ENABLE when the base image is upgraded to Caddy >= 2.11.5:
# remove these lines (and the CHANGELOG/SECURITY.md known-issues notes).

# CVE-2026-84304 — google.golang.org/grpc v1.82.1: gRPC vulnerability (xDS/HTTP-2 family).
# gRPC/xDS is not used by Caddy core in this deployment; not reachable. Patched in
# grpc v1.83.1 (needs coraza-caddy > v2.6.0 / Caddy >= 2.11.5).
CVE-2026-84304

# CVE-2026-84445 — google.golang.org/grpc v1.82.1: gRPC-Go xDS servers DoS (crash) via
# missing handling. Same gRPC/xDS family — not used by Caddy core in this deployment
# (reverse-proxy only); not reachable. Patched in grpc v1.82.2/v1.83.2 (needs
# coraza-caddy > v2.6.0 / Caddy >= 2.11.5).
CVE-2026-84445
